  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UGRO Capital Supporting Digital and Innovative Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises Financing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an eligible transaction under the Enhanced Faster Approach to Small Nonsovereign Transactions (FAST) framework.  The transaction involves a debt financing, through senior secured nonconvertible debentures, of up to $30,000,000 (in Indian rupee equivalent) to UGRO Capital Limited (UGRO) for the UGRO Capital Supporting Digital and Innovative Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises Financing Project.</narrative>
  </description>
